1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,280
Frodo!

2
00:00:02,280 --> 00:00:03,880
- Frodo!
- Sam!

3
00:00:03,960 --> 00:00:05,800
Bless you, you're awake!

4
00:00:05,880 --> 00:00:08,680
Sam has hardly left your side.

5
00:00:08,760 --> 00:00:11,480
We were that worried about you,
weren't we, Mr. Gandalf?

6
00:00:11,560 --> 00:00:16,200
By the skills of Lord Elrond,
you're beginning to mend.

7
00:00:17,840 --> 00:00:21,800
Welcome to Rivendell, Frodo Baggins.
